                                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#brand-development-graphic-design-collapseOne" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="brand-development-graphic-design-collapseOne">1. What is the operational difference between Graphic Design and Brand Identity Design?</button>
                                                                </h2>
                                                                <div id="brand-development-graphic-design-collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#brand-development-graphic-design-accordion">
                                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                        <p>Brand Identity Design is a high-level strategic process that builds your company's core visual DNA—establishing the permanent logo, color rules, and typography guidelines. Graphic Design is the ongoing tactical execution that applies that established DNA to create specific marketing materials, such as ad banners, presentation decks, or event brochures, for active campaigns.</p>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#brand-development-graphic-design-collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="brand-development-graphic-design-collapseTwo">2. How does professional graphic design directly impact our campaign conversion rates?</button>
                                                                </h2>
                                                                <div id="brand-development-graphic-design-collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#brand-development-graphic-design-accordion">
                                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                        <p>Cluttered, unvetted layouts create cognitive fatigue, causing users to bounce before understanding your value proposition. Our designs use strategic visual hierarchies and clean focal points to guide a user’s eyes naturally to your most important data, increasing comprehension and significantly accelerating the path to a form submission or purchase.</p>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
