                                                                </h2>
                                                                <div id="brand-development-graphic-design-collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#brand-development-graphic-design-accordion">
                                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                        <p>Yes, absolutely. We remove all future modification bottlenecks by providing full ownership of the final products. You receive your creative assets perfectly organized in raw, editable source files (such as Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, or Figma files) alongside optimized, production-ready output formats (such as print-ready PDFs, high-res JPEGs, and web-optimized SVGs).</p>
